✅ What to Back Up
Component	What it contains	How to back it up
🔹 PostgreSQL database	Metadata: users, repos, builds, etc.	pg_dump (SQL backup)
🔹 File system (filestore)	Actual artifacts (JARs, ZIPs, etc.)	Tar or rsync the directory
