This answer focuses on PostgreSQL backup only.

🧪 Step-by-Step: Manual Backup of PostgreSQL DB (Artifactory Metadata)
✅ Step 1: Identify PostgreSQL Credentials
Check your JFrog config (system.yaml or db.properties) for:

