Database name (commonly: artifactory)

Username

Password

✅ Step 2: Run pg_dump (outside or inside Docker)
🔹 If PostgreSQL runs natively (no Docker):
pg_dump -U artifactory -h localhost -F c -b -v -f /backup/artifactory_metadata.backup artifactory
-U artifactory → DB user

-h localhost → Hostname of DB

-F c → Custom format (compressed)

-b → Include large objects

-v → Verbose

-f → Output file

🔹 If PostgreSQL runs in Docker:
